#: dialogues/example.dialogue
msgid "Queres que che diga todas as opcións?"
msgstr "Do you want me to tell you all the options?"

#: dialogues/example.dialogue
msgid "Vai levar [shake rate=20 level=10]tempo[/shake]..."
msgstr "It will take [shake rate=20 level=10]time[/shake]..."

#: dialogues/example.dialogue
msgid "si"
msgstr "yes"

#: dialogues/example.dialogue
msgid "Que peñazo"
msgstr "What a drag"

#: dialogues/example.dialogue
msgid "non"
msgstr "no"

#: dialogues/example.dialogue
msgid "Estas son todas as opcions que che podo contar."
msgstr "These are all the options I can tell you."

#: dialogues/example.dialogue
msgid "Primeiro, podes mirar a planta con calma."
msgstr "First, you can look at the plant calmly."

#: dialogues/example.dialogue
msgid "Despois, podes volver falar comigo cando queiras."
msgstr "Afterward, you can talk to me again whenever you want."

#: dialogues/example.dialogue
msgid "Vale, entendo. Vou mirar con calma."
msgstr "Okay, I understand. I'll take a careful look."

#: dialogues/example.dialogue
msgid "Perfecto. Se atopas algo raro, volve e cóntamo."
msgstr "Perfect. If you find something strange, come back and tell me."

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "Esqueciches as herbiñas ou é que che sobra o tempo?"
msgstr "Did you forget the little herbs, or do you just have time to spare?"

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "Esta Mundo xa non rexe. Faltoulle o tomiño,"
msgstr "This Mundo brew no longer works. It's missing thyme,"

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "a menta, a ruda, e mais a macela."
msgstr "mint, rue, and chamomile."

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "E tamén o sabugueiro e a herba da Nosa Señora…"
msgstr "And also elder and Our Lady's bedstraw..."

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "E mira de levar silveira, pero ollo con prender nela!"
msgstr ""
"And make sure to bring bramble, but be careful not to get snagged on it!"

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "Esquecín, si"
msgstr "I forgot, yes"

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "Non"
msgstr "No"

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "Fiúncho, fento macho, herba luísa, xesta, romeu,"
msgstr "Fennel, male fern, lemon verbena, broom, rosemary,"

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "malva, herba de San Xoán…"
msgstr "mallow, St. John's wort..."

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "Se queres collelas todas, bule, paxarín,"
msgstr "If you want to gather them all, hurry up, little bird,"

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "que o [shake rate=20 level=5]tempo[/shake] voa como voa o vento!”."
msgstr ""
"because [shake rate=20 level=5]time[/shake] flies the way the wind flies!\"."

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Conseguiches {plant_name}!"
msgstr "You got {plant_name}!"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Se arraiar, se arraiará"
msgstr "If it takes root, it will take root"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "tódalas meigas levará;"
msgstr "it will carry off all the witches;"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "xa arraiou, xa arraiou,"
msgstr "it has already taken root, it has already taken root,"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "tódalas meigas levou."
msgstr "it carried off all the witches."

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Por ser noite de San Xoán"
msgstr "Because it is Saint John's night"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "noite de encantos e bruxas"
msgstr "a night of charms and witches"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "por ser noite de San Xoán"
msgstr "because it is Saint John's night"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "non teño medo, curuxa!"
msgstr "I am not afraid, owl!"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Vinte unha crara noite,"
msgstr "I came on a clear night,"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "noitiña de San Xoán,"
msgstr "little Saint John's night,"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "poñendo as frescas herbas"
msgstr "placing the fresh herbs"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "na fonte a serenar."
msgstr "in the fountain to steep."

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Amigue, irei ó San Xoán,"
msgstr "Friend, I will go to Saint John's,"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "queira ou non quera meu pai!"
msgstr "whether my father wants it or not!"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Agárdame na verbena"
msgstr "Wait for me at the festival"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "- enriba, na calle Maior-,"
msgstr "- up there, on Main Street -,"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Si non chego pola noite,"
msgstr "If I don't arrive at night,"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "hei de chegar polo albor."
msgstr "I'll arrive at dawn."

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Cacho tradicional"
msgstr "Traditional bunch"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Cacho invasor"
msgstr "Invasive bunch"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Cacho demasiado grande"
msgstr "Bunch too large"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Cacho demasiado pequeno"
msgstr "Bunch too small"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Cacho baleiro"
msgstr "Empty bunch"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Cacho mediocre"
msgstr "Mediocre bunch"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Arrincaches invasoras."
msgstr "You pulled up invasive plants."

#: dialogues/scene1/tutorial.dialogue
msgid "Nunca estouraches o estalo?"
msgstr "Have you never popped the popper?"

#: dialogues/scene1/tutorial.dialogue
msgid "Proba a cortalo e bótallo ao cacho:"
msgstr "Try cutting it and tossing it into the pile:"

#: dialogues/scene1/tutorial.dialogue
msgid "preme cando o punto de corte estea no verde claro"
msgstr "press when the cut point is in the light green"

#: dialogues/scene1/school_board.dialogue
msgid "Ao alumnado dos cursos que corresponda:"
msgstr "To the students of the corresponding grades:"

#: dialogues/scene1/school_board.dialogue
msgid "Materia: Ciencias da Terra e Botánica."
msgstr "Subject: Earth Sciences and Botany."

#: dialogues/scene1/school_board.dialogue
msgid "Contidos:"
msgstr "Contents:"

#: dialogues/scene1/school_board.dialogue
msgid "- Endemismos e plantas en perigo de extinción no"
msgstr "- Endemic species and plants in danger of extinction in the"

#: dialogues/scene1/school_board.dialogue
msgid "barrio de Duasaugas: detección e coidados in situ."
msgstr "Duasaugas neighborhood: detection and in situ care."

#: dialogues/scene1/school_board.dialogue
msgid "- Especies invasoras: como recoñecelas, cortalas e desbotalas."
msgstr ""
"- Invasive species: how to recognize them, cut them, and dispose of them."

#: dialogues/scene1/school_board.dialogue
msgid "Prácticum: Herbario de San Xoán. As herbas \"máxicas\" de Duasaugas."
msgstr "Practicum: Saint John's Herbarium. The \"magical\" herbs of Duasaugas."

#: dialogues/scene1/school_board.dialogue
msgid "Exame: 7 de setembro, aula 7G."
msgstr "Exam: September 7, classroom 7G."

#: dialogues/scene1/school_board.dialogue
msgid "Data límite de entrega: 7 de setembro"
msgstr "Submission deadline: September 7"

#: dialogues/intro.dialogue
msgid ""
"É a mañá do 23 de xuño, véspera de San Xoán, a data que marca no calendario "
"o final do curso escolar e o solsticio de verán."
msgstr ""
"It is the morning of June 23, the eve of Saint John, the date that marks on "
"the calendar the end of the school year and the summer solstice."

#: dialogues/intro.dialogue
msgid ""
"A xente de Dúasaugas prepárase para celebrar o Lumenovo, noite de culto, de "
"festa e de ritos de cambio de ciclo que se perden atrás na memoria."
msgstr ""
"The people of Dúasaugas are getting ready to celebrate Lumenovo, a night of "
"worship, celebration, and cycle-change rites that fade deep into memory."

#: dialogues/intro.dialogue
msgid ""
"Mais a vella Mundo, unha das veciñas máis lonxevas do barrio, lembra aínda o "
"nome das plantas que noutro tempo se usaban para curar feridas, espantar os "
"demos e protexer de meigas o berce, a casa e as cortes."
msgstr ""
"But old Mundo, one of the neighborhood's longest-lived residents, still "
"remembers the names of the plants that were once used to heal wounds, drive "
"away demons, and protect cradle, home, and byre from witches."

#: dialogues/intro.dialogue
msgid ""
"Os males de hoxe non son os que eran pero as Herbas de San Xoán aínda "
"funcionan como ritual de protección e purificación a calquera que crea nelas."
msgstr ""
"Today's evils are not what they used to be, but Saint John's Herbs still "
"work as a ritual of protection and purification for anyone who believes in "
"them."

#: dialogues/intro.dialogue
msgid "Cada unha co seu poder. Búscaas para escorrentar os malos espíritos…"
msgstr ""
"Each one has its own power. Seek them out to drive away evil spirits..."

#: dialogues/scene2/terrace_poster.dialogue
msgid "Aromáticas e medicinais plantadas pola"
msgstr "Aromatic and medicinal plants grown by the"

#: dialogues/scene2/terrace_poster.dialogue
msgid "comunidade do parque de Duasaugas."
msgstr "community of Duasaugas park."

#: dialogues/scene2/terrace_poster.dialogue
msgid "Cortar con tino. Non asulagar. Deixar para quen vén detrás."
msgstr "Cut with care. Do not overwater. Leave some for those who come after."

#: scripts/minigames/cutting_minigame.gd:76
msgid "Ben!"
msgstr "Great!"

#: scripts/minigames/cutting_minigame.gd:84
msgid "Fallaches"
msgstr "You missed"

msgid "Florilexio"
msgstr "Florilexio"
